<title>USA: Group cuts stake in Spreckels Industries.</title>
<headline>Group cuts stake in Spreckels Industries.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by American Enterprises LLC said Thursday it cut its stake in Spreckels Industries Inc to 1,001,260 common shares or 16.4 percent of 6,090,941 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 200,000 common shares on Sept 3 at $23.125 per share.</p>
</text>
